118^\circ = 52^\circ + \text{दूसरा कोण}
दूसरा अंतः सम्मुख कोण = 118^\circ - 52^\circ = 66^\circ

solution_steps_en:
Formula: Exterior angle = First interior opposite angle + Second interior opposite angle
118^\circ = 52^\circ + \text{other angle}
Other interior opposite angle = 118^\circ - 52^\circ = 66^\circ

